item purchasable with cash.\"\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Christmas Popper is an item that can be purchased at Santa's Workshop for 2,008 snowflakes during the Christmas event, or can be obtained through the advent calendar at the Christmas tree near <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. Upon putting it in your inventory and clicked while it is in the hand, it gives a object that can be purchased with cash from shop.\n</p><p>[As the price of that item increases, the chance of getting that item is less likely.]\n</p><p>Below is a table of everything known that the Christmas Popper  can give the player.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/XAND_Gate\" title=\"XAND Gate\">XAND gate</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/XAND_Gate_boxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20240112162944\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"XAND Gate boxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/XAND_Gate_boxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240112162944\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"185\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"XAND Gate boxed.png\" data-image-key=\"XAND_Gate_boxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/14_Segment_Display\" title=\"14 Segment Display\">14 Segment Display</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/14_Segment_Display_boxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20231230172536\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"14 Segment Display boxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/58/14_Segment_Display_boxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/135?cb=20231230172536\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" widt